  "long_description": "Within (formerly Klarity) is a Company Brain used by OpenAI, DoorDash, ServiceNow, Salesforce, JLL, McKesson for AI Transformation. Our product maps  how work actually gets done, structure it, and reallocate it between people and agents.\r\n\r\nDiscover: Employees log into our web app — nothing to install — share their screen, and work as usual. Within maps and anonymizes every task while sending Signals back to highlight what they do well.\r\n\r\nStructure: Within agents consolidate activity across the enterprise into a Company Brain: how work gets done, how decisions are made, how approvals flow, how controls are enforced, when work actually happens.\r\n\r\nImprove: Against your business objectives, Within finds the right opportunities for agents, builds those agents, and redesigns the people, process, and rituals around them.\r\n",
  "one_liner": "Company Brain for people and agents to work in harmony. ",
